OL,3,GNEWSAHarris asks politicians for
OL,4,Afeedback on Irish unity 'blueprint'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe tanaiste (Irish deputy prime
OL,7,Fminister) has asked some political
OL,8,Fparties in both Northern Ireland and
OL,9,Fthe republic for feedback on his
OL,10,Fparty's so-called "blueprint" on Irish
OL,11,Funity.
OL,13,FSimon Harris' party Fine Gael published
OL,14,Fproposals on how to prepare for Irish
OL,15,Funity last week.
OL,17,FIt came just days after the Taoiseach
OL,18,F(Irish prime minister), who is leader
OL,19,Fof Fianna Fail, circulated a document
OL,20,Fto his parliamentary party laying out
OL,21,Fhis own thoughts on how to prepare for
OL,22,Fa united Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
