OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHarris asks politicians for
OL,4,Afeedback on Irish unity 'blueprint'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmong their proposals, Fine Gael has
OL,7,Fsuggested appointing a junior minister
OL,8,Fin the Irish government for "north
OL,9,Fsouth relations" as well as
OL,10,Festablishing a forum on Irish unity.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
